  "manual.assortedstorage.chapter.locking": "Locks and Keys",
  "manual.assortedstorage.chapter.locking.containers": "A locked chest, barrel, hopper or shulker box keeps whatever was inside when the padlock went on. A locked ender chest opens the ender storage tied to its combination instead of your own.\n\nSneak and use it with an empty hand while you carry the matching key to take the padlock off and get the plain one back.",
  "manual.assortedstorage.chapter.locking.containers.title": "Locked Containers",
  "manual.assortedstorage.chapter.locking.doors": "Every vanilla door has a locked form, and so do the doors Assorted Building Blocks adds. There is no item to craft. Simply put a padlock on a door that is already placed and it becomes one.\n\nA locked door will not open to a hand, a key of the wrong combination, or redstone.",
  "manual.assortedstorage.chapter.locking.doors.title": "Locked Doors",
  "manual.assortedstorage.chapter.locking.key_ring": "A key ring carries several keys in one slot and tries all of them.",
  "manual.assortedstorage.chapter.locking.key_ring.title": "Key Ring",
  "manual.assortedstorage.chapter.locking.locks": "Use a padlock on a door, chest, ender chest, barrel, hopper or shulker box and it becomes the locked version of itself. The containers from the other Assorted Storage mods take one the same way.\n\nAfter that only a key with the matching combination opens it.",
  "manual.assortedstorage.chapter.locking.locks.title": "Padlocks and Keys",
  "manual.assortedstorage.chapter.locking.workbench": "The locksmith workbench is where a lock or a key is given its combination. Two locks with the same combination take the same key.",
  "manual.assortedstorage.chapter.locking.workbench.title": "Locksmith Workbench",
  "manual.assortedstorage.description": "Bigger containers, crates, portable storage, and locks for all of it.",
  "manual.assortedstorage.title": "Assorted Storage",
